# The block's `.shared` array `buf` hides the kernel's register `buf`,
# so the store's address is the array's, the same in every thread, one
# sector per warp request, as ptxas compiles it; it was the register's
# 4 * %tid.x.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/scoped_variable.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // global store [param_0 + buf$scope1] sectors/req 1 (ideal 1){{$}}
